&lt;p&gt;This role is fast-paced and client-facing with a focus on client portfolio growth and team development. You will spend most of your time developing growth strategies, executing projects, and coaching top performers. As a Client Solutions leader and first point of contact for our clients, you will also work alongside our product and engineering team to translate insights into product improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates have prior experience managing client-facing teams within enterprise business development and/or customer success. They love taking on new challenges while never taking things for granted. We are looking for candidates who are excited to face the successes and challenges of growing client portfolios and developing high-performance teams.&lt;/p&gt;
