&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You display a “challenge-accepted” mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about training, coaching, and developing talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You inspire and motivate your team to achieve ambitious goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are results-driven and excel at identifying new &amp;amp; innovative ways to drive growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of professional work experience in customer-facing roles; 1-2 years of experience managing a client-facing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
