&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Office Hours is an online platform that lets users earn income by sharing what they know. Users create knowledge profiles to accept hourly consultation requests or survey opportunities based on their professional expertise. Companies and organizations seeking unique insights can search the Office Hours marketplace to quickly find and learn from thousands of advisors on demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we believe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that human knowledge is the world’s most valuable asset. And yet, despite being more interconnected than ever, most knowledge still remains stuck in our heads, inaccessible and underutilized. Office Hours’ mission is to help everyone realize the value of what they know by building tools for the knowledge-sharing economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is headquartered in San Francisco and backed by top marketplace and business operators like&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://officehours.com/saar-gur&quot;&gt;Saar Gur&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://officehours.com/mlz&quot;&gt;Marco Zappacosta&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lennyrachitsky.com/&quot;&gt;Lenny Rachitsky&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://officehours.com/jacksongates&quot;&gt;Jackson Gates&lt;/a&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Levie&quot;&gt;Aaron Levie.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our customers include the fastest-growing digital health companies, software startups, venture capital firms, and leading consulting firms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an India-based recruiter to own sourcing, selecting, and hiring talent to help us scale our team to meet rapidly increasing demand. You will manage the full recruitment cycle, from identifying job openings and creating job descriptions to screening candidates, conducting initial interviews, and extending offers. You will work closely with leadership and hiring managers to define hiring needs, identify top talent, and create a strong company culture through recruitment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for candidates that are excited to face the joys and challenges of growing a business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with founders, executives, and hiring managers to understand team needs and align recruitment efforts with the company’s vision and growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Sourcing:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and engage top talent for technical and non-technical roles through job boards, social media, referrals, and networking events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Recruiting:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the entire recruitment process, from job postings and resume screenings to interviewing, negotiating offers, and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding:&lt;/strong&gt; Help craft and communicate the startup’s brand to attract top-tier candidates, emphasizing the company&#39;s culture, mission, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced, evolving environment with changing hiring needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think outside the box to find creative solutions to hiring challenges, especially in competitive job markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive when you truly own something&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong intuition for whether people will align with the company&#39;s values and growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years recruiting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working at a startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for both technical and non-technical roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, bonus, &amp;amp; stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation time, regular company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company retreats (Tahoe, Maui, Mendocino, Mexico City)&lt;/li&gt;
